# Normalize line endings in the repo to LF for every text file.
#
# Without this, editing on Windows (or any editor defaulting to CRLF)
# rewrites every line of every file, so `git diff` shows the whole project
# as changed and real edits become impossible to review. `* text=auto`
# stores LF in git and lets each checkout use its platform's convention.
* text=auto eol=lf

*.png binary
*.joblib binary
*.csv text eol=lf
